        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>EvoSprout</strong>, you can <strong><i>plant</i></strong>, <strong><i>grow</i></strong>, and <strong><i>harvest</i></strong> different fruits and vegetables. You can try combining them and <strong><i>cross-breeding</i></strong> their genetics to get even better yields. Level up, get more insight into the genetics of your produce, and see if you can claim the <strong><i>trophy</i></strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Full Disclaimer: <br>This game is just a private, game development side project I wanted to share with the world. Do not expect any future updates or support beyond critical fixes. Please feel free to share your opinions and suggestions.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>EvoSprout</strong>, you can <strong><i>plant</i></strong>, <strong><i>grow</i></strong>, and <strong><i>harvest</i></strong> different fruits and vegetables. You can try combining them and <strong><i>cross-breeding</i></strong> their genetics to get even better yields. Level up, get more insight into the genetics of your produce, and see if you can claim the <strong><i>trophy</i></strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Full Disclaimer: <br>This game is just a private, game development side project I wanted to share with the world. Do not expect any future updates or support beyond critical fixes. Please feel free to share your opinions and suggestions.</i></p>",
        "short_description": "EvoSprout is a casual, stress-free, small-scale farming simulator in a cozy low-poly environment. Manage your character's private garden-farm from a top-down perspective: Buy crops and upgrades, plant and harvest from your plots, and use your different stations to process and analyse your yield.",
